  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Number of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math>-bonds</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>HO</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><munder><mover><munder><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></mover><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></munder><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><munder><mover><munder><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></mover><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></munder><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>OH</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>So</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>OH</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><munder><mover><munder><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></mover><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></munder><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>OH</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>HO</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><munder><munder><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mover><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></munder><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>OH</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Therefore, the correct sequence of decreasing number of pi-bonds is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>&#8203;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8203;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. The numbers in bracket indicate the number of pi bonds.</p>"
